+    Consequently the top two coefficients before scaling are exactly 1,-2.
+    Since p=3 mod 4, H(y)^2+1 never vanishes in F_p, so y=2 is the
+    unique field root.  Rejection sampling only removes accidental zero,
+    duplicate, or additional -2 coefficient relations; it never searches for
+    the certificate.
